(Penny:)I could see him eating
one or two guests,

5
00:00:10,556 --> 00:00:13,356
(Penny:)but not a whole party.

6
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:15,589
(Bert:)Well, I guess this is
kind of a bust.

7
00:00:15,594 --> 00:00:17,324
(Bert:)You don't have to stay.

8
00:00:17,329 --> 00:00:19,559
