the same thing about you.

12
00:00:26,605 --> 00:00:27,675
(Bert:)Hey, listen,

13
00:00:27,673 --> 00:00:29,973
(Bert:)could you not
say anything about this

14
00:00:29,975 --> 00:00:31,705
(Bert:)to the people at the university?

15
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:33,440
(Bert:)You know, 'cause...

16
00:00:33,446 --> 00:00:36,616
(Bert:)you're you and I'm me,
and it's kind of embarrassing.

17
00:00:36,615 --> 00:00:38,915
(Penny:)Wait, what do you mean
"she's her"?

18
00:00:38,918 --> 00:00:41,818
(Bert:)Well, you know how Amy's the
coolest girl on campus, right?

19
00:00:41,821 --> 00:00:43,551
(Howard:)No.
No.

20
00:00:43,556 --> 00:00:45,626
(Bert:)Oh yeah, everybody thinks so.

21
00:00:45,624 --> 00:00:47,094
(Howard:)What?

22
00:00:47,093 --> 00:00:51,993
(Penny:)You tell me about your foot
fungus, but this is a secret?

